@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2C3E50
    LifeLineBorderColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantBorderColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #ECF0F1
}

title Orquestación Genérica de Listas, Filtrado y Edición

actor "Usuario (Admin)" as U
participant "ListGenerator" as LG
participant "SearchBar" as SB
participant "MassEditWizard" as Wizard
participant "EditFormGenerator" as Form
participant "Backend API" as API

== Orquestación y Filtrado ==

U -> LG: Entra en vista (e.g. Usuarios)
LG -> LG: Inicializar Estados (data, page, selectedIds)
LG -> SB: Renderizar con datos originales

U -> SB: Filtra datos (visto en diagrama anterior)
SB -> LG: setFiltered(results)
LG -> LG: resetPage(1)
LG -> LG: useMemo (paginatedData, renderedData)
LG -> U: Muestra lista filtrada y paginada

== Ciclo de Vida de Edición Masiva (Wizard) ==

U -> LG: Selecciona múltiples items
U -> LG: Click en "Mass Edit"
LG -> Wizard: Abrir con selectedItems

activate Wizard
Wizard -> Wizard: Inicializar editHistory (original, versions[], activeVersion)
note right: Nivel 2: Sistema de versiones\npara soporte de Undo/Redo

loop Para cada item seleccionado
    Wizard -> Form: Renderizar Formulario para item[i]
    U -> Form: Modifica campos y click "Update & Next"
    Form -> Wizard: applyUpdate(updatedEntity)
    Wizard -> Wizard: hasChanges() check
    Wizard -> Wizard: push version & activeVersion++
    Wizard -> Wizard: structuredClone(updated)
    Wizard -> Wizard: setActiveIndex(i + 1)
end

U -> Wizard: Click "Review"
Wizard -> U: Muestra ReviewModal (Diferencias Original vs Editado)

U -> Wizard: Confirmar Cambios
Wizard -> API: PUT /api/v1/resource/mass-edit (JSON con IDs y Entidades)
activate API
API --> Wizard: 200 OK [UpdatedEntities]
deactivate API

Wizard -> LG: onClose(updatedEntities)
deactivate Wizard

LG -> LG: setSortedData(Actualizar items locales)
LG -> LG: setSelectedIds(new Set())
LG -> U: Refresca vista con datos actualizados

@enduml
